### 总览
GET http://localhost:8028/api/resolver/overview

### 缺少用户 → code=401（HTTP 仍是 200，信封由 common 处理）
GET http://localhost:8028/api/resolver/me

### 注入当前用户，并包进 R
GET http://localhost:8028/api/resolver/me
X-User-Id: 7
X-User-Name: ada

### 可选用户：没有请求头就是访客
GET http://localhost:8028/api/resolver/me/optional

### 返回值已经是 R，不再套一层
GET http://localhost:8028/api/resolver/already-wrapped

### 没有 @ApiResult，响应体就是资料本身
GET http://localhost:8028/api/resolver/plain
X-User-Id: 7
X-User-Name: ada
